Absolutely. Use this as the master build prompt in your coding agent. It captures the complete idea we've developed without locking the product to farmers, SIH, AI, or sensors.

Build a production-quality MVP called Problem Intelligence.

1. Product vision

Create a platform that helps people discover real-world problems worth solving as businesses.

The product philosophy is:

«Don't ask AI what to build. Ask people what hurts — collect evidence, validate the problem, determine whether someone will pay, and only then decide what technology should solve it.»

The platform must be problem-first, evidence-first, and human-in-the-loop.

It must NOT be positioned as:

- an AI startup idea generator
- a farmer-only application
- an SIH-only application
- an AI chatbot
- a sensor-only application

It should support problems from any industry or human context.

Possible solution types:

- Software
- AI
- Hardware
- Sensors / IoT
- Robotics
- Service
- Marketplace
- Combination of technologies

